@startuml
title US12 - Register an Employee\nDomain Model (DM)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9E6
skinparam linetype ortho

hide methods
hide circle

class Administrator

class Employee {
    ID
    name
    phoneNumber
    emailAddress
    doctorIndexNumber [0..1]
}

class Role {
    name
}

Administrator "1" ---- "1..*" Employee : manages / registers >
Employee "0..*" --- "1" Role : is assigned to >

note bottom of Employee
Doctor Index Number is mandatory
when the assigned role
is Specialist Doctor.
end note



@enduml
